0.920 0.960 0.990 rg 49 492.0 497 25 re f
0.080 0.140 0.250 rg BT /F2 12.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 500.0 Tm (Theory) Tj ET
0.060 0.480 0.720 rg BT /F2 10.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 463.0 Tm (1. setInterval\(\) and live countdowns) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 444.0 Tm (setInterval\(callback, delay\) schedules repeated work. A countdown can calculate the) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 431.0 Tm (remaining time until a target date and refresh its display once per second. The interval) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 418.0 Tm (should be cleared when the target is reached or the countdown is replaced.) Tj ET
0.060 0.480 0.720 rg BT /F2 10.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 396.0 Tm (2. setTimeout\(\) and scheduled alerts) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 377.0 Tm (setTimeout\(callback, delay\) schedules a one-time callback. It is suitable for a reminder or) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 364.0 Tm (notification after a delay. Timer identifiers allow pending work to be cancelled with) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 351.0 Tm (clearTimeout\(\).) Tj ET
0.060 0.480 0.720 rg BT /F2 10.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 329.0 Tm (3. ES6 modules with import and export) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 310.0 Tm (ES modules divide a program into files with explicit exports and imports. Separating timer) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 297.0 Tm (calculations, scheduler data operations, and UI rendering makes each module easier to) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 284.0 Tm (understand and reuse. Browsers load module scripts using type="module".) Tj ET
0.060 0.480 0.720 rg BT /F2 10.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 262.0 Tm (4. Countdown and scheduler updates) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 243.0 Tm (A scheduler stores class details such as subject, instructor, location, start time, and) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 230.0 Tm (duration. The application selects the next relevant class, updates the countdown, and) Tj ET
0.140 0.190 0.270 rg BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 217.0 Tm (refreshes the schedule when a class is added or deleted.) Tj ET
